    "title": "Student brings BB gun onto Poplar Bluff school bus, district says - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Sasha Moore ,\n1 days ago POPLAR BLUFF, Mo., (KBSI) – School officials say a student brought a BB gun onto a school bus Tuesday morning. Poplar Bluff Public Schools Superintendent Dr. Aaron Cornman said the incident occurred April 14. A middle school student alerted staff that a classmate claimed to have a gun, which could be felt inside a backpack. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
